<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴλιγγ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴλλω, εἴλω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spinning round</i>; esp. <i>swimming</i> in the
			head, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				3.17
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				407c
			</span></i> (pl.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοτοδινίαν ἴλιγγόν τε ἐμποιεῖν τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					892e
				</span></i>
			; also, <i>disturbance of the bowels</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				597
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>eddies</i> or <i>wreaths</i> of smoke, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.142
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>whirlpool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Goth.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>agitation of mind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1068c
			</span></i>:—also written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴλιγγος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Caes.</u>
				60
			</span></i>, and codd. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
